Add tools suite, consent, build status, animated landing and more

- 15 free browser tools at /tools (password gen, QR, hashing, Base64, URL,
  UUID, JSON, word counter, case, lorem, color, timestamp, slug, markdown,
  diff) with index, dynamic pages, JSON-LD and sitemap entries
- Cookie consent banner (Accept / Reject / Customize) gating Google Analytics
- Professional floating WhatsApp button + scroll-to-top button
- Dynamic build-info status strip in the footer (version, commit, build age,
  live operational pulse) injected via next.config
- Professional /welcome onboarding page
- Animated tech background + auto-rotating feature slider on the landing page
- Theme presets (Indigo, Midnight, Ocean, Emerald, Sunset, Rose, Slate, Mono)
- More accessibility options: invert colors, bigger targets, highlight on
  hover, hide backgrounds
- Copy: "no sign-up" updated to "one-time free sign-up"
- docs/CONFIGURATION.md documenting all env vars (REDIS, COTURN, TURN, STUN,
  PEERJS, Supabase, SMTP, analytics)

